  "anti_redundancy": [
    "Do not create a Spirit Room; Spirit remains a center-native role/relation owned by project canon and compared across existing Rooms.",
    "Do not create a Memory realm; chronology and archive Rooms already own occurrence, provenance, recovery and interpretation.",
    "Do not make Culture synonymous with Strife; Garden-like and Strife-like cultural directions are outcomes of formation, not definitions of culture.",
    "Do not turn body metaphors into anatomy.",
    "Do not let this coordination map become a replacement ontology for Rooms."
  ]
